<title>INDONESIA: Bank Tiara 9-mth net edges up.</title>
<headline>Bank Tiara 9-mth net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   28.59 vs 23.51</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   159 vs 143</p>
<p>    Net interest income		66.26 vs 52.65</p>
<p>    Other operating income	    2.74 vs 1.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net profit		 40.85 vs 33.59</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bank Tiara Asia is a medium-sized Jakarta-based bank. Earnings per share adjusted for 30 million bonus shares issued in June.</p>
</text>
